\f1\fs22 Sarah spent the rest of the morning gathering everything known about Tony of ENCHANTED Cleaning. 
\f2\i Everything
\f1\i0 , however, amounted to very little. But to her, the spaces where data had once been were as obvious as tooth decay. Much was recently deleted, as recently as this morning. No matter how deep she dug, all she uncovered regarding SupTones was: a birth certificate (
\f2\i father unknown
\f1\i0 ), patchy school records (noting his obstreperousness in the face of poor grades), a listing for ENCHANTED Cleaning (no business address), and some fines for drunk and disorderly. There were no consumer records. There was no evidence of any marketing advertising algorithms apprising him worthy of spamming. Sarah raised her eyebrow when she searched for malware attacks against him and found none.\
Was Mr Fairy Boxers too dull to surveil?\
Sarah stared out the window with a blank thousand-metre stare. On another day, she might have shrugged off a visit from a creepy agent. She could handle those, but the cleaner couldn\'92t mend his own overalls. He\'92d be no match for a PAPER agent. Sarah would have to warn him.\
When 1:30pm approached, she took a hover-copt to the clinic where she gave samples, underwent embarrassing and probing examinations. A colony of scanners bombarded her with a broad spectrum of radiation. As expected, she was in perfect health, and therefore approved for promotion.\
One result gave her cause for reflection.\
\
PREGNANCY: not pregnant\
\
Sarah went home and resumed searching for Mr Fairy Boxers\'97a home address, or even a regular watering hole. On an impulse borne of desperation, she gathered a cloak, tied her hair back, and called a hover-copt for The Ghetto, where she did the rounds of bars where vanilla Cloudborne mixed with the Elvi. A nagging hunch\'97or perhaps the only drive she could raise enthusiasm for\'97suggested Mr Fairy Boxers might enjoy karaoke.\
Her dim hunch ignited into a solid lead at the 
\f2\i Viva Vegas Club
\f1\i0  where a waiter named Danny-Sue knew the names \'91ENCHANTED Cleaning\'92 and \'91Tony Chantara\'92, and was familiar with the tear in his overalls.\
\'91Go check out the 
\f2\i Stickett Inn
\f1\i0 , sugar,\'92 Danny-Sue told Sarah. \'91That\'92s where his bodyguards usually hole him up.\'92\
